description	"Darth Tenebrous

Bith Sith Master, with specialized high damage force powers.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Lightsaber (Blue/Yellow Style)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)

^8Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Kill (Grip 1) ^3[CS3]
-- 460% more damage
- Crimson Lightning (2) ^3[CS1]
-- 100% More Damage
- Sense (3) ^3[CS2]
- Defense (2)
- Deflect (3)

^8Attributes:
- Anti-MT (2)
- Force Sense Immunity
- Force Focus (2)
- Force Block (3)
- Beskar (1)
- Cortosis (1)
- Magnetic Plating
- Blast Armor
